{"q":"136","t":"Single Number","d":"Easy","p":false,"c":"<p>Given a <strong>non-empty</strong>&nbsp;array of integers <code>nums</code>, every element appears <em>twice</em> except for one. Find that single one.</p>\n\n<p>You must&nbsp;implement a solution with a linear runtime complexity and use&nbsp;only constant&nbsp;extra space.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 1:</strong></p>\n\n<div class=\"example-block\">\n<p><strong>Input:</strong> <span class=\"example-io\">nums = [2,2,1]</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>Output:</strong> <span class=\"example-io\">1</span></p>\n</div>\n\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 2:</strong></p>\n\n<div class=\"example-block\">\n<p><strong>Input:</strong> <span class=\"example-io\">nums = [4,1,2,1,2]</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>Output:</strong> <span class=\"example-io\">4</span></p>\n</div>\n\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 3:</strong></p>\n\n<div class=\"example-block\">\n<p><strong>Input:</strong> <span class=\"example-io\">nums = [1]</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>Output:</strong> <span class=\"example-io\">1</span></p>\n</div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><code>1 &lt;= nums.length &lt;= 3 * 10<sup>4</sup></code></li>\n\t<li><code>-3 * 10<sup>4</sup> &lt;= nums[i] &lt;= 3 * 10<sup>4</sup></code></li>\n\t<li>Each element in the array appears twice except for one element which appears only once.</li>\n</ul>\n","h":["Think about the XOR (^) operator's property."],"m":"{\r\n  \"name\": \"singleNumber\",\r\n  \"params\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"nums\",\r\n      \"type\": \"integer[]\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"return\": {\r\n    \"type\": \"integer\"\r\n  }\r\n}","g":[{"name":"Array","slug":"array"},{"name":"Bit Manipulation","slug":"bit-manipulation"}],"s":[{"t":"Single Number II","s":"single-number-ii","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Single Number III","s":"single-number-iii","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Missing Number","s":"missing-number","d":"Easy","p":false},{"t":"Find the Duplicate Number","s":"find-the-duplicate-number","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Find the Difference","s":"find-the-difference","d":"Easy","p":false},{"t":"Find the XOR of Numbers Which Appear Twice","s":"find-the-xor-of-numbers-which-appear-twice","d":"Easy","p":false}],"co":[["Bloomberg","bloomberg"],["Amazon","amazon"],["Google","google"],["Meta","facebook"],["Microsoft","microsoft"],["tcs","tcs"],["Accenture","accenture"],["Qualcomm","qualcomm"],["Airbnb","airbnb"],["Palantir","palantir"]],"cs":{"a":[["Google","google",8],["Bloomberg","bloomberg",7],["Meta","facebook",5],["Microsoft","microsoft",5],["Amazon","amazon",5]],"b":[["tcs","tcs",3]],"m":[["Adobe","adobe",2],["Goldman Sachs","goldman-sachs",2],["Cisco","cisco",2],["Accenture","accenture",2],["Cognizant","cognizant",2]]}}